    - target: {fileID: 5465895152699412473, guid: 1a0e5e51bf7774343a95886bd0381dbe,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Dear [Player's Name], \r\n \r\nI hope this letter finds you well and
        settling comfortably into the neighborhood. It\u2019s been wonderful seeing
        the community come together lately, and I wanted to personally reach out
        to you about something important. \r\n \r\nAt SKY, the NGO I work with, we\u2019re
        launching a campaign to protect a large plot of land right here in town.
        We\u2019re proposing to turn it into a beautiful community forest, a space
        for nature, families, and future generations to enjoy. But there\u2019s a
        catch. A big corporation is pushing to develop the same land into yet another
        mall. The final decision is in the hands of the people, and a petition will
        determine which vision wins. \r\n \r\nWe need all the support we can get
        to make this happen. After seeing your enthusiasm and hare work for the birthday
        party I believe you\u2019d be a perfect fit to help us spread the word with
        the same passion for community work and solidarity. If you\u2019re interested,
        come by the SKY office today. I\u2019ll give you a quick tour and explain
        everything in detail. \r\n \r\nLooking forward to seeing you there! \r\nBest
        regards, \r\nMarcus"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5465895152699412473, guid: 1a0e5e51bf7774343a95886bd0381dbe,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontSize
      value: 24
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
