    - target: {fileID: 6926559537471027529, guid: 13824c621f28cb147a8a508fc0aab5f8,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: playerTransformation
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 280196184}
    - target: {fileID: 6926559537471027529, guid: 13824c621f28cb147a8a508fc0aab5f8,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: slideTexts.Array.size
      value: 8
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6926559537471027529, guid: 13824c621f28cb147a8a508fc0aab5f8,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: pictures.Array.data[7]
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9dadb0172728ddc47be5ac647a21a037,
        type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 6926559537471027529, guid: 13824c621f28cb147a8a508fc0aab5f8,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: slideTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: "Marcus: Hello and welcome to SKY office, it is so nice to finally see
        you. \r\n\r\nPlayer: Hello Marcus, I read your letter and came right away.
        So, what is going on here? "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6926559537471027529, guid: 13824c621f28cb147a8a508fc0aab5f8,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: slideTexts.Array.data[1]
      value: "Marcus: This is where we try to make things happen for the community.
        As you can see people around you are having meetings and working on different
        projects in this office. And right now, we\u2019re facing one of our biggest
        challenges yet. Follow me I will show you. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6926559537471027529, guid: 13824c621f28cb147a8a508fc0aab5f8,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: slideTexts.Array.data[2]
      value: "Marcus: This is our current venture. We want to turn it into a community
        forest, a green space for people to enjoy. It could be a place the whole
        town takes pride in. But\u2026 "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6926559537471027529, guid: 13824c621f28cb147a8a508fc0aab5f8,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: slideTexts.Array.data[3]
      value: "Marcus: A development company has its eyes on this spot, too. They\u2019re
        pushing to build a shopping mall right here. They\u2019ve already started
        talks with the mayor, and now the town must decide between a forest or a
        mall. The mayor agreed to let the people vote through a petition, and that\u2019s
        where we come in. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6926559537471027529, guid: 13824c621f28cb147a8a508fc0aab5f8,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: slideTexts.Array.data[4]
      value: "Marcus: We need to convince as many people as possible to support the
        forest. To do that, we have to spread the word, clear up doubts, and rally
        support before the petition deadline. It\u2019s not just about asking people
        to sign; it\u2019s about showing them why this matters. \n\nMarcus: These
        pins mark the tasks we need to complete. You can check the details on the
        task board.  You\u2019ll be working in a team of young people towards these
        efforts. The tasks are varied, some need materials, and a few might need
        some extra creativity to handle. \r"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6926559537471027529, guid: 13824c621f28cb147a8a508fc0aab5f8,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: slideTexts.Array.data[5]
      value: "Marcus: This isn\u2019t going to be easy. Not everyone\u2019s on board,
        and we\u2019ve already run into a few hiccups, flyers going missing, tools
        mysteriously breaking. But we\u2019ll push through no worries. This isn\u2019t
        just about the forest; it\u2019s about protecting the future of this town.
        \r\nSo, what do you say? Are you in? \r\n \r\nPlayer: Absolutely! I\u2019m
        in. \r\n \r\nMarcus: That\u2019s the spirit!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6926559537471027529, guid: 13824c621f28cb147a8a508fc0aab5f8,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: slideTexts.Array.data[6]
      value: "Marcus: You can see all the tasks here, you can start by delivering
        the flyers. After that go in order. The sooner we get the word out, the better
        chance we have to win this thing. And remember, time\u2019s ticking, so let\u2019s
        make every moment count.\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6926559537471027529, guid: 13824c621f28cb147a8a508fc0aab5f8,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: slideTexts.Array.data[7]
      value: " \rMarcus: Oh, and before I forget, see that room over there? That\u2019s
        our supply room. It\u2019s stocked with most of the materials you\u2019ll
        need to complete the tasks. Posters, leaflets, paint, you name it.Whenever
        you activate a task from the board, the items you\u2019ll need for it will
        show up in there. Just make sure to grab what you need before heading out.\n\nPlayer:
        Got it. Thank you!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6926559537471027529, guid: 13824c621f28cb147a8a508fc0aab5f8,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: permanentlyDisabledObject1
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 8688358573616782058}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
    m_RemovedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedComponents:
    - targetCorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 6407506513767524569, guid: 13824c621f28cb147a8a508fc0aab5f8,
        type: 3}
      insertIndex: -1
      addedObject: {fileID: 1967191674}
  m_SourcePrefab: {fileID: 100100000, guid: 13824c621f28cb147a8a508fc0aab5f8, type: 3}
