      propertyPath: slideTexts.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 80691133462350864, guid: bd36b20666e548b4bb50e281e9aedc67,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: slideTexts.Array.data[0]
      value: "Layla: Oh my goodness, I can\u2019t believe this many people actually
        showed up! I thought it was going to be just a few of us. \r\n \r\nPlayer:
        I donno how! Looks like everyone\u2019s having a good time, even the grumpy
        dog. \r\n \r\nLayla: And it\u2019s all thanks to you! I couldn\u2019t have
        done this without your help. I was really starting to worry when no one had
        responded, but you went above and beyond. You really brought the community
        together."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 80691133462350864, guid: bd36b20666e548b4bb50e281e9aedc67,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: slideTexts.Array.data[1]
      value: "Player:I\u2019m glad I could help. Nice to see the neighborhood come
        together.\n\nLayla: It really is. I\u2019ve been here a while, and it hasn\u2019t
        felt this lively in ages. You\u2019ve got a real gift for connecting people,
        you\u2019ve made a big difference already. \r\n \r\nPlayer: That\u2019s really
        kind of you to say, thank you."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 80691133462350864, guid: bd36b20666e548b4bb50e281e9aedc67,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: slideTexts.Array.data[2]
      value: "Player: That\u2019s really kind of you to say, thank you. \r\n \r\nLayla:
        You should be proud! It\u2019s people like you who bring out the best in
        a place like this. Oh, before I forget, there\u2019s someone I want you to
        meet. He\u2019s a close friend of mine\u2014Marcus. \r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 80691133462350864, guid: bd36b20666e548b4bb50e281e9aedc67,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: slideTexts.Array.data[3]
      value: "Layla: Marcus works at SKY, an NGO that organizes community events
        and activities. I thought you two would get along.\n\nMarcus: Hey there!
        It\u2019s great to meet you. I\u2019m Marcus. \r\n\r\nPlayer: Nice to meet
        you, Marcus! Layla mentioned you work with an NGO? "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 80691133462350864, guid: bd36b20666e548b4bb50e281e9aedc67,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: slideTexts.Array.data[4]
      value: "Marcus: Yeah, that\u2019s right. I\u2019ve been with them for a few
        years now. It\u2019s really rewarding, but it wouldn\u2019t be possible without
        people like you stepping up. You know, I think you\u2019d be a great fit
        for some of the projects we\u2019ve got coming up. If you\u2019re interested,
        we can talk more sometime. \r\n\nPlayer:I\u2019d love to hear more about
        it. Thanks, Marcus!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 80691133462350864, guid: bd36b20666e548b4bb50e281e9aedc67,
        type: 3}
